SUMMARY:Vintage Car Show w/Beer City Blazers
DESCRIPTION:Rev Your Engines\nand head over to our place on Saturday September 5th! Bring your Hot Rods\, Muscle Cars\, Customs & Classics – anything vintage! \nThe Beer City Blazers is an Asheville-based non-profit organization and community group that organizes motorcycle rides\, casual meetups\, and charity events in Western North Carolina. Gearing up for September 27th’s Distinguished Gentlemen’s Drive\, they’re inviting you to come connect\, check out cool classic cars\, and learn more about BCB & the DGD. \nFree to attend. 11a-3pm.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/vintage-car-show-w-beer-city-blazers/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/BCB-Car-Show-9-5-26.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=a7de939e64899e01fe9a8242845fca59
END:VEVENT
