SUMMARY:Puppy Palooza: Dog Festival Benefiting Brother Wolf
DESCRIPTION:Puppy Palooza is Back!\nGather your pals and furry friends and head our way for this second annual fundraising event benefiting Brother Wolf Animal Rescue. We’re bringin’ all the best doggie-centric local businesses to one place so you can shop for all your treats\, pet spa and even fitness needs! Treat your pup to some doggie ice cream\, snap a photo at our free polaroid booth\, and spin the wheel to win prizes for your pets! \nMore fun & games in store\, so bark your calendar and we’ll see you there. \n 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/puppy-palooza-dog-festival-benefiting-brother-wolf/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Puppy-Palooza-Instagram-Post-45.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=4a44fda9b13157946bece9d124b00201
END:VEVENT
