SUMMARY:Dealmaker WNC
DESCRIPTION:Western North Carolina’s newest real estate networking community for investors\, agents\, lenders\, and dealmakers.\nDealmaker WNC is a relationship-driven real estate network in Western North Carolina designed to connect investors\, agents\, lenders\, and operators who are serious about doing business. \nThis isn’t a room full of people handing out business cards and hoping something sticks. \nWe will host Dealmaker the First Tuesday each month!\n Learn More & RSVP
