SUMMARY:SONG-O with Divine
DESCRIPTION:“Song-O! With Divine” Brings Free Music\, Drag\, and Bingo Fun to Asheville!\nAsheville\, NC – Looking for an unforgettable night of music\, laughter\, and fabulous drag entertainment? Look no further than “Song-O! With Divine”\, the free\, high-energy event that blends music bingo\, delicious drinks\, and the electric personality of Divinity Holeburn! \nHosted by the charismatic and dazzling Divinity Holeburn\, this isn’t your average bingo night—it’s Song-O!\, where music takes center stage and lucky winners get more than just prizes… they get toasted and roasted in style! With each round\, guests will groove along to a mix of iconic hits\, testing their music knowledge while enjoying a night of uninhibited fun. \nWhy You Can’t Miss Song-O! With Divine: \n\nFREE Admission – That’s right\, it’s 100% free to play!\nMusic Bingo with a Twist – Sing along\, mark your Song-O! cards\, and win fantastic prizes.\nDivine Entertainment – Drag superstar Divinity Holeburn hosts with wit\, humor\, and dazzling performances.\nA Must-Stop on Your Asheville Adventure – Whether you’re a local or visiting\, this event is the perfect way to spice up your night!\n\nSong-O! With Divine is more than just a game—it’s a full-on food\, drink\, and fun-stravaganza where every round is a party\, and everyone is a winner in one way or another! Whether you’re a drag aficionado\, a music bingo fanatic\, or just looking for a fabulous and unique way to spend your evening\, this is the event for you. \nSo grab your friends\, warm up those vocal cords\, and get ready to experience Asheville’s most exciting free night out!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/song-o-with-divine-2/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/SongO-700-x-500-px-1.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=1214df524a477da961a593323bdc0347
END:VEVENT
