SUMMARY:PechaKucha Night AVL: v42
DESCRIPTION:PechaKucha Night Returns in September for Volume 42 at The Mule!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPechaKucha Night Asheville is an evening of presentations by the most creative and interesting people in our city\, all following the beautifully simple PechaKucha 20×20 format: 20 images\, shown for 20 seconds each. With 400 seconds to tell their story\, each unique presentation is succinct. You never know what you’ll learn or who you’ll see at PechaKucha. Learn more at https://pechakuchaavl.org\, on Instagram @pechakuchaavl\, or on Facebook at https://www.facebook.com/pknavl.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDoors: 6pm\nShow: 7:30p\n\n\n\n\n September Tickets On Sale Now!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/pechakucha-night-avl-v42/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/PKNv42-poster-8.5x11.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=3cec17071710bdd96dce57239504d5b8
END:VEVENT
